
    Operation: Elimination takes place in a three dimensional maze-like
complex.  Within the complex you will encounter other cyborgs and equipment
which you will employ to survive.  The complex is a constantly changing
environment: walls and doors are frequently blown apart and rebuilt and new
rooms are constantly being added as high explosives carve out new cavities
in the ground.

    Eight skills determine your level of ability in the game.  They are:
strength, dexterity, constitution, marksmanship, single-fire weapons,
automatic weapons, heavy weapons, and construction.  Your skill levels may
be raised with special medical facilities.

    Death in Operation: Elimination is never permanent.  Your cyborg is
reactivated immediately following termination, albeit with slightly lower
skill levels.

